      "description": {
        "fun": "Weedle's red-and-yellow colouring is a warning to predators, and it backs it up with a 5 cm venomous stinger on its head and a barbed one on its tail. Its keen sense of smell sniffs out its favourite leaves, and every day it eats its own weight in them. Its name mixes 'worm' and 'needle'.",
        "guide": "A Bug and Poison Pokémon resembling a larva, with a venomous stinger on its head and another on its tail. Its bright colours warn predators that it is poisonous. It evolves into Kakuna and then Beedrill.",
