      "description": {
        "fun": "Kakuna hangs from branches on long strands of silk and stays almost perfectly still while it waits to evolve, growing warm to the touch as the moment nears. Don't mistake that for helplessness: if attacked, it can poke out poison barbs. Oddly, its English name sounds more Japanese than its Japanese one, which is simply Cocoon.",
        "guide": "The cocoon stage of Weedle's line, a yellow Bug and Poison Pokémon that hangs from branches by silk while it waits to evolve. It barely moves but can extend poison barbs when attacked, and its body heats up as Evolution nears. It evolves into Beedrill.",
        "tagline": "A dangling cocoon that's warm, still and not quite defenceless",
