      "description": {
        "fun": "Beedrill fight as a swarm: disturb one and the whole group comes after you, flying at high speed with drill-like stingers on their forelegs and a third, most venomous one on the abdomen. They're especially protective of Weedle and Kakuna. Paired with Butterfree, it seems to echo the boxing line 'float like a butterfly, sting like a bee'.",
        "guide": "A large, wasp-like Bug and Poison Pokémon with venomous stingers on its forelegs and abdomen. It is very territorial and attacks in groups when disturbed. It is the final stage of Weedle's line and can Mega Evolve into Mega Beedrill.",
